#: ../../source/docs/common-dronecan-serial.rst:5
#: 26c957cdefda455c97892b3565d767dd
msgid "DroneCAN Serial PassThrough"
msgstr "DroneCAN串口直通"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dronecan-serial.rst:7
#: a168fe8158824d21b2a08776055370df
msgid ""
"Normally, any serial port on an AP-Peripheral device, like a :ref:`common-"
"uavcan-adapter-node` will be pre-configured for a specific peripheral (like "
"a GPS or Rangefinder)to be attached to one or more of its UARTs."
msgstr ""
"通常，AP外设设备（如 :ref:`common-uavcan-adapter-"
"node`）上的任何串口都会预配置为连接到其一个或多个UART上的特定外设（如GPS或测距仪）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dronecan-serial.rst:9
#: a80ebb0a395d43cc96068b50d1fdb1a0
msgid ""
"However, firmware versions V4.5 and later have added the ability to "
"bibidirectionally pass through data to a DroneCAN peripheral device that has"
" serial ports defined."
msgstr "但是，V4.5及更高版本的固件新增了向具有串口定义的DroneCAN外设设备双向透传数据的能力。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dronecan-serial.rst:11
#: 09c377f1c05046048f8b1e3a1483fe25
msgid ""
"Up to three ports can be mapped into the vehicle from the peripheral and "
"their baud rate and protocol programmed with ArduPilot parameters:"
msgstr "最多可将三个串口从外设映射到飞行器，并使用ArduPilot参数编程其波特率和协议："

#: ../../source/docs/common-dronecan-serial.rst:13
#: a2bfbfb4a41d4ad9ae4b14e3d1cf2c0b
msgid "First, the CAN port driver must be set to \"DroneCAN\" protocol."
msgstr "首先，CAN接口驱动必须设置为「DroneCAN」协议。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dronecan-serial.rst:14
#: 43f527040a6a46e19bb859fa3dc4622b
msgid ""
"Second, the driver's ``CAN_Dx_UC_SER_EN`` must be set to \"1\"  to enable "
"this feature. A reboot may be required to allow the following parameters to "
"be shown and set. Note that up to 3 serial ports may be enabled per driver. "
"For the following only the first port (1) parameters will be listed:"
msgstr ""
"其次，驱动的 ``CAN_Dx_UC_SER_EN`` "
"必须设置为「1」以启用此功能。可能需要重启才能显示和设置以下参数。注意每个驱动最多可启用3个串口。以下仅列出第一个串口（1）的参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-dronecan-serial.rst:16
#: 1297aedebc794ad6b83f7c8e635ba7d3
msgid ""
":ref:`CAN_D1_UC_S1_NOD<CAN_D1_UC_S1_NOD>`: CAN remote node number for serial"
" port. See \"Setting the Node Number\" section below."
msgstr ""
":ref:`CAN_D1_UC_S1_NOD<CAN_D1_UC_S1_NOD>`：串口的CAN远程节点编号。参见下方「设置节点编号」章节。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dronecan-serial.rst:17
#: cab32241a7014625960c62e5ec9114e5
msgid ""
":ref:`CAN_D1_UC_S1_IDX<CAN_D1_UC_S1_IDX>`: The peripheral' Serial Port index"
" that the following parameters apply. This selects the SERIALx of the "
"peripheral and its corresponding UART. Consult the peripherals "
"specifications or its \"hwdef.dat\" file `here "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef>`__"
" to determine its index."
msgstr ""
":ref:`CAN_D1_UC_S1_IDX<CAN_D1_UC_S1_IDX>`：以下参数适用的外设串口索引。该索引选择外设的SERIALx及其对应的UART。请查阅外设规格书或其「hwdef.dat」文件（`此处"
" "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef>`__）以确定其索引。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dronecan-serial.rst:18
#: 6c1c3e79ca9a44999984fcbac929fb9f
msgid ":ref:`CAN_D1_UC_S1_BD<CAN_D1_UC_S1_BD>`: The baud rate for the port"
msgstr ":ref:`CAN_D1_UC_S1_BD<CAN_D1_UC_S1_BD>`：端口的波特率"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dronecan-serial.rst:19
#: 03b722aa948c40d6b595576e9c100be8
msgid ""
":ref:`CAN_D1_UC_S1_PRO<CAN_D1_UC_S1_PRO>`: The ports protocol for the "
"device/connection to its UART."
msgstr ":ref:`CAN_D1_UC_S1_PRO<CAN_D1_UC_S1_PRO>`：设备/连接到其UART的端口协议。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dronecan-serial.rst:22
#: 5318d6db0adf43228a946b9b71a2babf
msgid "Setting the Node Number"
msgstr "设置节点编号"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dronecan-serial.rst:24
#: 785eef0292ae42d4be21ba260373e38a
msgid ""
"DroneCAN peripherals usually get a CAN bus node number automatically "
"assigned by ArduPilot. For most peripheral setups, knowledge of this node "
"number is not needed by the user (the exception being two DroneCAN GPSs in a"
" Moving Baseline configuration). However, for Serial passthrough, this "
"number is needed to be determined and placed in the ``CAN_Dx_UC_S1_NOD`` "
"parameter to enable communication to occur properly."
msgstr ""
"DroneCAN外设通常由ArduPilot自动分配CAN总线节点编号。对于大多数外设配置，用户无需知道此节点编号（例外情况为动基线配置中的两个DroneCAN"
" GPS）。但对于串口直通，需要确定此编号并填入 ``CAN_Dx_UC_S1_NOD`` 参数以确保通信正常。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dronecan-serial.rst:26
#: 48c817d5c45b465da695508544cb4846
msgid ""
"The user can attach the DroneCAN device and look up its node number using "
":ref:`Mission Planner <dronecan-uavcan-slcan>` or :ref:`the DroneCAN "
"GUI<dronecan-uavcan-slcan>`. It is recommended to also change the "
"peripheral's ``CAN_NODE`` parameter on the peripheral from \"0\" to the one "
"assigned by ArduPilot to prevent its changing on subsequent system "
"reconfigurations and invalidating the value set in ``CAN_Dx_UC_S1_NOD`` "
"parameter."
msgstr ""
"用户可连接DroneCAN设备，使用 :ref:`Mission Planner <dronecan-uavcan-slcan>` 或 "
":ref:`DroneCAN GUI<dronecan-uavcan-slcan>` 查找其节点编号。建议同时将外设的 ``CAN_NODE`` "
"参数从「0」改为ArduPilot分配的编号，以防止在后续系统重新配置时发生变化而导致 ``CAN_Dx_UC_S1_NOD`` 参数中的值失效。"
